## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / outcrop
The ice sample is labelled, and the photographs record the specimen and the core’s layers. These observations do not yet establish how old the layers are or how they formed.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / outcrop
The route passes exposed ice and a layered cliff. I will label and photograph the samples so that each observation stays connected with the place it came from.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / weather
