Make protected controller

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / weather
Dust is moving across the route. I can repair this old weather station and use its observations to decide when to travel.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / weather
The station record shows an interval of better visibility, and the spare controller is protected. We can continue to the relay.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / weather
Dust is moving across the route. I can repair this old weather station and use its observations to decide when to travel.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / relay
Set rover course to the crew

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / relay
The relay mast reaches beyond the ridge. I need to contact the missing crew, locate their reported landmark and load the directions into the rover.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / relay
Their cabin is intact; its drive has failed. Their location is loaded into our rover. We can go to them.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / skip bridge / relay
The missing crew have answered. Their cabin is intact; its drive has failed. We know where they are.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / relay
The relay mast reaches beyond the ridge. I need to contact the missing crew, locate their reported landmark and load the directions into the rover.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / rescue
Bring crew to shelter
Feed sheltered crew

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / rescue
The crew answers: their cabin is intact, but the crawler's drive has failed. I can repair the drive and help them reach the nearby refuge.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / rescue
Everyone is sheltered and fed. The habitat's mission stores will support us until the scheduled return flight. We can prepare for it together.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / skip bridge / rescue
Everyone is sheltered and fed. With the recovered crew beside us, we can prepare together for the scheduled return window.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / rescue
The crew answers: their cabin is intact, but the crawler's drive has failed. I can repair the drive and help them reach the nearby refuge.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / rescue
The crew have reached the nearby service refuge. Its shelter and bedding stores are here; first I need to make it warm and welcoming.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / camp
Make shared lit workbench
Send crew message home

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / camp
The crew is sheltered and fed. In the refuge's workcourt, I can prepare a lit workbench and contact our families.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / camp
We have a lit bench to share, and our families have heard our voices. This is starting to feel like a camp again.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / camp
The crew is sheltered and fed. In the refuge's workcourt, I can prepare a lit workbench and contact our families.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / cargo-return
Take crew supper portrait

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / cargo-return
The crew's furniture sled is a short walk from camp. I will bring back their table and take a photograph of everyone together.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / cargo-return
We have recovered the crew's table and taken a photograph of everyone together. We can keep the portrait with our expedition records.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / cargo-return
The crew's furniture sled is a short walk from camp. I will bring back their table and take a photograph of everyone together.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / night
Compare wall cooling
Insulate our refuge

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / night
The refuge loses heat at night. In the thermal test bay, I can compare coverings before fitting a screen to its exposed service wall.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / night
The chamber comparison gave us a reason to fit this screen. The refuge still holds the bed we made for the rescued crew; now its exposed service wall is covered too.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / night
The refuge loses heat at night. In the thermal test bay, I can compare coverings before fitting a screen to its exposed service wall.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / waterworks
Make camp water system

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / waterworks
Beyond camp is an enclosed ice-processing system with a drained pump loop. The water I saved may let me restart it and supply the camp's growing system.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / waterworks
The camp's process-water loop is working again. It supplies the enclosed growing system, not drinking water.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / waterworks
Beyond camp is an enclosed ice-processing system with a drained pump loop. The water I saved may let me restart it and supply the camp's growing system.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / garden
Grow potatoes; share meal

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / garden
Our mission stores cover the months until the return flight. In the greenhouse, there is time to grow food and prepare the beds for the crews who follow.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / garden
After several weeks of growth, the greenhouse has produced a crop. We can share a meal from the potatoes we grew.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / skip bridge / garden
After several weeks of growth, the greenhouse has produced a crop. We can share a meal from the potatoes we grew.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / garden
Our mission stores cover the months until the return flight. In the greenhouse, there is time to grow food and prepare the beds for the crews who follow.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / nursery
Camp nursery

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / nursery
The greenhouse has produced potatoes, and the small tray from landing is still growing. At the nursery bench, I can prepare a lasting place for its seedlings.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / nursery
The little tray from landing has a supported place in the greenhouse nursery. We’re leaving something living for the next crew, not just repaired equipment.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / nursery
The greenhouse has produced potatoes, and the small tray from landing is still growing. At the nursery bench, I can prepare a lasting place for its seedlings.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / workshop
Fit crawler sample carrier
Fit replacement wheel

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / workshop
The crawler needs a replacement wheel and a carrier for the samples. The enclosed machine shop has equipment for making and fitting them.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / workshop
The replacement wheel is fitted, and our samples have a protected carrier. The crawler can take the next leg with the things we worked to save.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / workshop
The crawler needs a replacement wheel and a carrier for the samples. The enclosed machine shop has equipment for making and fitting them.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / traverse
Fit crawler traverse

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / traverse
The ascent depot lies beyond rough lava. At this scout station, I can use aerial observations to plan the crawler's route.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / traverse
The scout’s images have become a marked route for the crawler. A view from above helps—but we still need to look at the ground beneath our wheels.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / traverse
The ascent depot lies beyond rough lava. At this scout station, I can use aerial observations to plan the crawler's route.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / crossing
Mark surveyed channel
Place crawler at channel

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / crossing
The aerial view suggested a possible crossing. Here at the channel, I need ground measurements before bringing the crawler onto the approach.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / crossing
The approach is marked, and the crawler is here on the wheel we fitted at camp, with its sample carrier aboard. The checks cover this approach, not the whole channel. We can take the next leg together.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / crossing
The aerial view suggested a possible crossing. Here at the channel, I need ground measurements before bringing the crawler onto the approach.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / buried-story
Record the basin findings
Store sediment sample

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / buried-story
The basin contains layers of different sediments. I will collect and record a core without claiming more about its history than the evidence shows.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / buried-story
A coarse band lies between two finer layers. We have kept the specimen and recorded the layers, but do not yet know what carried the grains here. Nearby ripples and gravel may help us investigate.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / buried-story
The basin contains layers of different sediments. I will collect and record a core without claiming more about its history than the evidence shows.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / contrast
Compare basin photographs
Save basin comparison
Keep specimens separate

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / contrast
The rippled surface and nearby gravel are different sources of evidence. I will compare their photographs and keep the specimens and records separate.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / contrast
The ripples alone do not establish that a river flowed here. The gravel and surrounding rock layers provide stronger evidence of ancient water. The two sites and their records remain separate so others can check the comparison.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / contrast
The rippled surface and nearby gravel are different sources of evidence. I will compare their photographs and keep the specimens and records separate.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / depot-way
Depot cargo shuttle

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / depot-way
The old depot markers lead toward a stored cargo hauler. The dark surface tracks have changed, so I will follow the fixed markers and use our spare controller to repair the hauler.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / depot-way
The permanent markers led us back to the service route, not the wandering dark tracks. That controller we protected now runs the hauler that will carry our samples to the ship.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / depot-way
The old depot markers lead toward a stored cargo hauler. The dark surface tracks have changed, so I will follow the fixed markers and use our spare controller to repair the hauler.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / oxygen
Restore plant; service oxygen

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / oxygen
The ascent depot's oxygen plant is still here. In its service bay, I can restore the equipment needed to prepare the vehicle's oxygen module.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / oxygen
The hauler we restored has brought the heavy module onto its proper interface, and the depot plant has serviced it. The module now has a real place in the waiting vehicle; the hauler is free for our specimens.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / oxygen
The ascent depot's oxygen plant is still here. In its service bay, I can restore the equipment needed to prepare the vehicle's oxygen module.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / ascent
Make cabin test record

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / ascent
The oxygen plant is working. Across the depot, I can repair the waiting cabin and check its test record before planning the flight home.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / ascent
The cabin is restored, and its built-in test record is in hand. Now we can turn from repairing our ship to agreeing where it will meet the orbiter.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / ascent
The oxygen plant is working. Across the depot, I can repair the waiting cabin and check its test record before planning the flight home.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / rendezvous
Make agreed rendezvous

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / rendezvous
At the clear-sky station, I can compare clocks, observations and beacon measurements with the orbiter. We need to agree where and when the ships will meet.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / rendezvous
The clocks, observations and beacon measurements agree. We now have a time and place to meet the orbiter.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / rendezvous
At the clear-sky station, I can compare clocks, observations and beacon measurements with the orbiter. We need to agree where and when the ships will meet.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / objective / departure
Prepare specimen transport cart
Make camp handover beacon
Archive the crew portrait

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / entry fallback / departure
Back at camp, I will pack the specimens, save the crew portrait and prepare a handover signal for the next crew.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / completion/ending / departure
The specimens, their records and our portrait are ready to travel. The handover beacon tells the next crew what we leave behind—including a living nursery.

## mars-purposeful-fieldwork-v8 / story body / departure
Back at camp, I will pack the specimens, save the crew portrait and prepare a handover signal for the next crew.

