Can a payment replace repentance?

## divinity-final-reading-scenes-v7 / entry fallback / coin-and-supper
A household has one coin and no supper. Compare Luther's priority for helping people with the seller's promise that payment can release a dead soul from punishment. The seller's claim is not the same as official teaching.

## divinity-final-reading-scenes-v7 / completion/ending / coin-and-supper
Luther gives food for the household priority over an indulgence. A seller's promise cannot guarantee release for a dead soul or give the seller control over God's mercy.

