What do later good deeds change?

## divinity-final-reading-scenes-v7 / entry fallback / response-and-growth
The council distinguishes God's first help, an adult's response and later growth in righteousness. Compare these with Luther's claims without saying that either side teaches people to buy God's acceptance.

## divinity-final-reading-scenes-v7 / completion/ending / response-and-growth
Trent says God's help comes first and an adult can accept or refuse it. Luther and Trent still disagree about inward renewal and the later role of good deeds.

